n\n◯内容\n・上のコマは全身のイラスト。フカン視点に足を引っ張って床に座るの体勢。\n・衣装はデフォルトのもの、すべて着衣のまま。\n・下は小さなコマ、足の描写のみ、フロント視点に片足を引く、半透明な粘液を通して片足の足の裏がわずか    \nに見えます。\n\n◯参考\nニィロウ-東風はこぶ花の吐息\nhttps://imgur.com/a/I84zHxA\nhttps://x.com/Genshin_7/status/1814133066463330436\nシーンの参考\nhttps://lh3.googleusercontent.com/zUKCUPW5AavVHpH2tXuTXzleuG_ydxM2GvKJ0yMa0ciRoa4nBsHhUkSgx77ZkP5gohyT-DI9l1V4R7N_SknnPKrGhWsa4MCXK2rYV4Aj91Ln=rw\nhttps://imgur.com/a/DGa4Kdn\nポーズとコマの割合に関する参考画像\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/99963835", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@misora_sorairo/works/20", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b89bafcd/uploads/origins/286fed7a-712d-46ef-82df-d229fbb6df0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b4edc86f3fa521fc6a9f98027a4ee77e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b89bafcd/uploads/origins/286fed7a-712d-46ef-82df-d229fbb6df0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b4edc86f3fa521fc6a9f98027a4ee77e, https://si.imgix.net/b89bafcd/uploads/origins/286fed7a-712d-46ef-82df-d229fbb6df0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8190bd66f3342c95bbbce0e45c11dedc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b89bafcd/uploads/origins/286fed7a-712d-46ef-82df-d229fbb6df0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fc6f3f7d65edc4cbadf817c55cae36d4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "東北イタコ氏の胸像を一枚所望致したく候", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@misora_sorairo/works/19", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6b75c0f0/uploads/origins/91691c51-9f74-4b96-94bd-a5e8df2f9d70?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a9450c7f076bf5df617516a61b906471", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6b75c0f0/uploads/origins/91691c51-9f74-4b96-94bd-a5e8df2f9d70?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a9450c7f076bf5df617516a61b906471, https://si.imgix.net/6b75c0f0/uploads/origins/91691c51-9f74-4b96